From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Artem Butusov <art.sormy@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: display: meson-dw-hdmi: Add GXLX2 and ddc-i2c-bus

GXLX2 (S905L3) maps the controller directly, as G12A does, with GXL's
PHY: its own compatible, beside the GX fallback. A board that wires the
connector's DDC to other pins than the controller's names that I2C bus
as ddc-i2c-bus, which the DesignWare core reads.

Signed-off-by: Artem Butusov <art.sormy@gmail.com>
---
diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/amlogic,meson-dw-hdmi.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/amlogic,meson-dw-hdmi.yaml
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/amlogic,meson-dw-hdmi.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/amlogic,meson-dw-hdmi.yaml
@@ -51,11 +51,18 @@
           - enum:
               - amlogic,meson-gxbb-dw-hdmi # GXBB (S905)
               - amlogic,meson-gxl-dw-hdmi # GXL (S905X, S905D)
+              - amlogic,meson-gxlx2-dw-hdmi # GXLX2 (S905L3)
               - amlogic,meson-gxm-dw-hdmi # GXM (S912)
           - const: amlogic,meson-gx-dw-hdmi
       - enum:
           - amlogic,meson-g12a-dw-hdmi # G12A (S905X2, S905Y2, S905D2)
 
+  ddc-i2c-bus:
+    $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/phandle
+    description:
+      The I2C bus the HDMI connector's DDC lines are wired to, where the board
+      routes them to other pins than the controller's own.
+
   reg:
     maxItems: 1
 
